                             1) we select number 1 by user 
                             2) we select oprater form user eg:+,-,*
                             3) we select number 2 form user 
                             
                             after that opration will be perform 
                          and we will get our result
                          
  //------------------------------------------------------------------
  
  After getting result if user want to coutinue opration 
  we add while loop 
  
  
  *inside of that loop user can use result as number 1 for opration
  *user have to select the oprater direct after result to do opration will result
  *after selecting opration user have to select number to get result 
  * and it will contune until user want 
  * if user select oprater as 0 then system will be close 
  
                             
                             
                              
                             